WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.700
Hello, Vogue Thailand!

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.800
- I'm Miu Natsha.
- I'm Lena Lalina.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.900
Getting a good night's sleep is a must.
Like today, we didn't get much sleep,

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.100
so I feel like my energy's only at 20%.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.310
- You're eating your hair!
- Eating it?

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.200
- Yep.
- Didn't notice. Gotta eat hair before work.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.100
How do I prep before work?

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:30.900
Any way to prep? None at all. As long
as I get to sleep, that's the best.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:41.100
I also have to eat well. Eating meals on
time gives me more energy while I work.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:47.100
For me, as long as I enjoy and appreciate
everything around me, big or small,

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:55.400
or sometimes just yummy food, lovely
people, a good team. That's enough for me.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:00.100
For me, it's probably about
the objective of each job.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:04.000
Meaning when we work, we should
know what that day's objective is.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.390
Once we get the objective, we know: OK,
today calls for this tone, this mood.

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:11.000
We see the big picture.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:18.700
The big picture helps me channel my energy
into that mood, so it turns out well,

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:23.500
and we can enjoy everything around
us once we know the goal of the job.

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:29.437
Every time I work with Chanel,
I discover something new.

00:01:29.437 --> 00:01:32.500
New scents, new jewelry, new clothes.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.300
Yes. This collection is one we
went to see together in Paris.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:41.200
Seeing each model wear it feels
totally different from when I wear it.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:46.100
So I think the excitement is in
getting to try on new things,

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:51.900
and seeing how much of each
outfit's vibe I can bring out.

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:55.800
Like exploring together with the brand.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:03.692
I think they have to be someone true to
themselves, confident in who they are.

00:02:03.692 --> 00:02:08.292
They have to feel confident wearing this,
being themselves like this,

00:02:08.292 --> 00:02:13.592
and carry that confidence into whatever
they do, whoever they meet, every day,

00:02:13.592 --> 00:02:17.092
with confidence, boldness,
and self-assurance.

00:02:17.092 --> 00:02:23.392
To me, someone who wears Chanel,
or Chanel itself, is not just confident

00:02:23.392 --> 00:02:28.092
but also vibrant and full of life,

00:02:28.092 --> 00:02:33.092
meaning they're free to choose
to do anything they want in life,

00:02:33.092 --> 00:02:38.892
with no filters,
nothing that can stop them.

00:02:38.892 --> 00:02:46.992
They look confident and bright, or at
times they have a presence all their own.

00:02:46.992 --> 00:02:51.292
There's no look we wore as a pair
that made me go: Hey, that's me.

00:02:51.292 --> 00:02:57.592
It's probably the solo looks that feel
like me. Mine would probably be the

00:02:57.592 --> 00:03:01.692
dress with the petticoat inside.
It feels so me, it has a

00:03:01.692 --> 00:03:06.892
really unique vibe… but still within…
And I love stuff like that.

00:03:06.892 --> 00:03:11.192
Like, just walking in it,
it has this… I love that.

00:03:11.192 --> 00:03:20.892
Mine's probably the red top inside with
the skirt, and also… stuff like that.

00:03:20.892 --> 00:03:24.157
It feels bright,
kind of the opposite of me.

00:03:24.157 --> 00:03:27.792
Or maybe not,
sometimes I have a bright side too.

00:03:27.792 --> 00:03:32.192
It kind of draws out
the bright side of me,

00:03:32.192 --> 00:03:38.092
plus the skirt is pretty short, showing
my legs, and that's the style I like:

00:03:38.092 --> 00:03:42.958
covered on top,
but with a bit of skin showing.

00:03:42.958 --> 00:03:46.892
So that outfit feels the most like me.

00:03:46.892 --> 00:03:56.092
I was just an ordinary girl who
studied hard and hadn't worked much,

00:03:56.092 --> 00:03:58.895
still a student.
Then I got to do a series,

00:03:58.895 --> 00:04:03.394
work in a setting I'd never been in,
try new things, meet new people,

00:04:03.394 --> 00:04:08.794
got to know so many lovely people,
and got to do the work I'd dreamed of,

00:04:08.794 --> 00:04:11.494
work I never thought I'd get to do,

00:04:11.494 --> 00:04:16.294
including days like today.
Everything's a bonus in life now.

00:04:16.294 --> 00:04:20.894
Life before? In short,
I was a kid who kept chasing goals,

00:04:20.894 --> 00:04:25.073
and whenever a new goal came up,
I'd try to tick it off one by one,

00:04:25.073 --> 00:04:27.194
until this opportunity came along.

00:04:27.194 --> 00:04:32.994
How has it changed?
In that more people see me now.

00:04:32.994 --> 00:04:37.327
I've been acting for years,
and with this role and new ones,

00:04:37.327 --> 00:04:40.794
people know me more,
both as Lena and as Lalina,

00:04:40.794 --> 00:04:45.394
and see the skills I've built over
the years, getting to showcase

00:04:45.394 --> 00:04:50.394
acting techniques I've worked so hard
to craft. I'm glad people get to see

00:04:50.394 --> 00:04:57.294
the heart I've put into my work.

00:05:10.094 --> 00:05:17.094
- Here it is!
- Yeah.

00:05:17.094 --> 00:05:21.388
- Whoa, it's amazing!
- See? I told you!

00:05:21.388 --> 00:05:24.394
- This one's really amazing.

00:05:25.294 --> 00:05:30.194
So happy, really happy!
I've been on a Vogue cover once before,

00:05:30.194 --> 00:05:35.094
and Vogue is the magazine my mom's
subscribed to for over 10 years,

00:05:35.094 --> 00:05:40.094
I always saw it at home.
Today's our first Vogue cover together,

00:05:40.094 --> 00:05:45.094
so I feel proud and fulfilled,
proud like: Wow, one day

00:05:45.094 --> 00:05:48.994
P'Lena and I are on the cover of Vogue.

00:05:48.994 --> 00:05:52.894
And it's the November issue too,
our birthday month.

00:05:52.894 --> 00:05:56.794
- Truly.
- So everything's special. It feels great.

00:05:56.794 --> 00:05:58.094
It was meant to be.

00:05:58.094 --> 00:06:02.122
Yes. I only found out this
morning it's the November cover.

00:06:02.122 --> 00:06:05.195
I thought it was just
a regular inside shoot.

00:06:05.195 --> 00:06:06.495
Thank you, Vogue.

00:06:06.495 --> 00:06:11.095
In short: it's Vogue,
who wouldn't want to be on the cover?

00:06:11.095 --> 00:06:14.495
The name Vogue alone is
impactful and powerful enough.

00:06:14.495 --> 00:06:20.091
I'm so happy Lena and Miu made
Vogue's November cover today.

00:06:20.091 --> 00:06:22.795
Please support us, thank you!

